1
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,280
As if drifting through the deep sea

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,440
Funny thing

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,480
The deep sea has neon lights too

4
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:13,140
Sea creatures hunt with light

5
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:17,460
The ocean is just like this theatre

6
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,960
The deeper you go

7
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,560
The fewer people there are

8
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:29,700
Since it's a so-called collective creation

9
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,700
No director, no stage manager

10
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:33,000
Countless slip-ups at every step

11
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:35,120
In the script my name is Number One

12
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:35,790
How can you talk to a customer like that?

13
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:39,030
The customer is your God

14
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:39,300
Now God wants to know your name

15
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:45,490
You think I'm a robber?

16
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:45,950
You're in control of everything

17
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:48,560
Don't shoot

18
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,060
if our roles were reversed

19
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:54,610
I'd beg you to shoot, no hesitation

20
00:00:54,610 --> 00:00:54,900
Goodbye

21
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:55,160
What?

22
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:57,160
How does The Internationale go?

23
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:59,200
Arise, ye who refuse to be slaves

24
00:01:01,830 --> 00:01:05,000
Who made the rules?

25
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:05,310
Elite of the elite

26
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:07,720
While he's like a rat

27
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,720
Living in the sewer

28
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,000
So terrified by the vast sewage system

29
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:10,250
Then where will you go?

30
00:01:10,250 --> 00:01:15,650
I am a lone island

31
00:01:15,650 --> 00:01:18,730
Where does the ocean flow?

32
00:01:18,730 --> 00:01:19,000
What?

33
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:19,260
I need to put myself back together

34
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:21,420
Will you wait for me?

35
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:21,700
Did I ever say that?

36
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:24,370
Are you an idealist?

37
00:01:24,370 --> 00:01:26,590
I think I am

38
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,120
Did you think the play was good?

39
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,120
It was awful

40
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,120
What a piece of junk

41
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:34,120
But I kind of loved it

42
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:37,300
I like bad plays

43
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:39,300
Because I'm a bad person

44
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:39,600
What's a good play anyway?

